# Application Architecture

Before implementing or reviewing matched application files:

1. Read `DESIGN.md`.
2. Load `.agents/skills/application-architecture/SKILL.md`.

Frontend work follows pragmatic Atomic Design with route orchestration and feature API code kept outside visual component layers. Backend HTTP work follows the strict flow: decode bounded JSON, reject unknown fields, map DTOs, invoke services, map domain errors, and serialize explicit `snake_case` response DTOs.
